{% case product.handle %}
  {% when '5-niacinamide-serum-acne-prone-skin' %}
    <p>A treat-step serum for oily, acne-prone Indian skin. Encapsulated Niacinamide at 5% sits in a stabilised matrix with SEPICONCONTROL™ A5 and Zinc PCA on a second oil-regulation pathway — so clarity work does not mean stripping comfort.</p>
  {% when 'calming-moisturiser-acne-prone-skin' %}
    <p>Barrier-first moisturiser for acne-prone routines. Plant-derived C15-19 Alkane, ceramides, and a six-botanical complex hydrate and support tone without greasing under SPF — because cream alone cannot fix a compromised lipid layer.</p>
  {% when 'refreshing-cleanser-acne-prone-skin' %}
    <p>Rinse-off clarification with functional acids: 2% Salicylic Acid inside the pore, 1% Glycolic Acid on the surface. Mild surfactants and phospholipids clean without turning cleanse into a strip.</p>
  {% when 'protecting-sunscreen-acne-prone-skin' %}
    <p>Daily photoprotection built as routine architecture for Indian UV — not a seasonal add-on. Four-filter hybrid coverage with Zinc PCA for wearability on oily, acne-prone skin.</p>
  {% when 'clear-seal' %}
    <p>A liquid patch that dries to an invisible film while Salicylic Acid, Glycolic Acid, and Niacinamide work on the breakout. Shields from dirt and picking without the bulk of a traditional patch.</p>
  {% when 'active-boba-encapsulated-cream-acne-prone-skin' %}
    <p>Multi-action capsule cream that keeps treatment actives separated until application. Congestion, tone, and barrier support in one step — designed so acne care does not abandon the lipid layer.</p>
  {% when 'project-skin-complete-4-step-skincare-routine-kit' %}
    <p>The full Project Skin sequence in one kit: cleanse with functional BHA/AHA, treat with 5% encapsulated Niacinamide, moisturise for barrier support, protect with four-filter SPF 50.</p>
{% endcase %}
